      "start_year": 1991,
      "description": "Sukhwinder Singh is a renowned Indian playback singer famous for his energetic and soulful voice in Bollywood films. He has contributed to numerous hit songs across various Indian languages, primarily Hindi. His singing style blends classical Indian music with contemporary Bollywood sounds, making him a versatile and popular artist in the Indian music industry.",
