      "cultural_impact": "Lata Mangeshkar had a profound impact on Indian popular culture, becoming a symbol of Indian music and cinema. Her voice defined an era of Bollywood music and inspired generations of singers. She helped popularize Indian music worldwide and was a unifying cultural figure across diverse linguistic and regional audiences.",
